传输方式：HTTP\n协议版本：rein-extension/0.1\n运行状态：由 Rust core 保存\n调用记录：包含派发、回收和终态\n\n这份资料说明早期运行配置的字段含义。它还描述了宿主与核心之间怎样交换一条消息，但没有给出吞吐量、并发容量或线上服务指标。阅读者应把明确事实行和背景段落分开。\n\n背景说明：TypeScript 宿主提供领域工具，Rust core 管理权威状态。独立进程只提供进程边界，不自动成为安全沙箱。任何回答都要回到实际发送的消息。\n","toolCallId":"call-3"}],"estimatedUnits":2145,"selectedSources":["doc-06","doc-04","doc-01"],"operations":[{"callId":"call-1","path":"docs/release.md","score":2,"strategy":"retrieval","tool":"read_file"},{"callId":"call-2","path":"docs/indexing.md","score":1,"strategy":"retrieval","tool":"read_file"},{"callId":"call-3","path":"docs/early-runtime.md","score":0,"strategy":"retrieval","tool":"read_file"}],"answer":{"rawAnswer":"检查命令：npm run ch08:verify（来源：doc-06）","claims":[{"field":"检查命令","value":"npm run ch08:verify","source":"doc-06"}],"insufficientEvidence":false},"quality":1.0,"unsupportedClaims":[],"elapsedMs":157,"serviceTokens":null,"modelCalls":1,"callRecords":[{"task_id":"task-93767-7-1789451706582540000","request_id":"request-1","call_id":"call-1","prepared":true,"dispatched":true,"terminal":"succeeded","reason":"succeeded","child_pid":97967,"exit_code":0,"reaped":true},{"task_id":"task-93767-7-1789451706582540000","request_id":"request-2","call_id":"call-2","prepared":true,"dispatched":true,"terminal":"succeeded","reason":"succeeded","child_pid":97981,"exit_code":0,"reaped":true},{"task_id":"task-93767-7-1789451706582540000","request_id":"request-3","call_id":"call-3","prepared":true,"dispatched":true,"terminal":"succeeded","reason":"succeeded","child_pid":97990,"exit_code":0,"reaped":true}]},{"taskId":"task-03","strategy":"on-demand","question":"批准规则与失败处理如何应对文件基线变化？批准状态和处理动作分别是什么？","budget":2400,"status":"completed","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"只根据实际读取的资料回答"},{"role":"system","content":"每个事实必须给出来源"},{"role":"user","content":"批准规则与失败处理如何应对文件基线变化？批准状态和处理动作分别是什么？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call-1","name":"read_file","arguments":{"path":"docs/approval.md"}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[来源:doc-03]\n# 批准规则\n\n基线条件：文件基线必须与批准时一致\n批准状态：需要重新批准\n权限范围：只允许声明过的路径\n结果采纳：核对任务、调用和目标版本\n\n批准资料规定了基线变化时的状态。它没有说明失败后应该怎样恢复，也没有给出生产吞吐量。来源标记必须来自实际读入这份文档的消息。\n\n背景说明：权限是核心作出的决定，宿主只执行已经允许的只读操作。批准状态不等于文件内容已经被读取，仍需留下实际工具结果。\n","toolCallId":"call-1"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call-2","name":"read_file","arguments":{"path":"docs/failure.md"}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[来源:doc-05]\n# 失败处理\n\n处理动作：停止并重新读取基线\n断连结果：记录 outcome_unknown\n重试条件：重新确认状态和预算\n缺失文件处理：返回读取错误\n\n失败处理资料把文件基线变化和恢复动作分开说明。断连后不能因为进程退出就猜测成功；只有重新确认状态和证据后才可决定重试。本资料没有生产吞吐量或发布命令事实。\n\n背景说明：错误响应、越界路径、缺失文件和无响应都应该成为可观察终态。离线回答器没有权限替错误补充事实。\n","toolCallId":"call-2"}],"estimatedUnits":1544,"selectedSources":["doc-03","doc-05"],"operations":[{"callId":"call-1","path":"docs/approval.md","score":null,"strategy":"on-demand","tool":"read_file"},{"callId":"call-2","path":"docs/failure.md","score":null,"strategy":"on-demand","tool":"read_file"}],"answer":{"rawAnswer":"批准状态：需要重新批准（来源：doc-03）\n处理动作：停止并重新读取基线（来源：doc-05）","claims":[{"field":"批准状态","value":"需要重新批准","source":"doc-03"},{"field":"处理动作","value":"停止并重新读取基线","source":"doc-05"}],"insufficientEvidence":false},"quality":1.0,"unsupportedClaims":[],"elapsedMs":100,"serviceTokens":null,"modelCalls":1,"callRecords":[{"task_id":"task-93767-8-1789451706739633000","request_id":"request-1","call_id":"call-1","prepared":true,"dispatched":true,"terminal":"succeeded","reason":"succeeded","child_pid":98000,"exit_code":0,"reaped":true},{"task_id":"task-93767-8-1789451706739633000","request_id":"request-2","call_id":"call-2","prepared":true,"dispatched":true,"terminal":"succeeded","reason":"succeeded","child_pid":98032,"exit_code":0,"reaped":true}]},{"taskId":"task-03","strategy":"window","question":"批准规则与失败处理如何应对文件基线变化？批准状态和处理动作分别是什么？","budget":2400,"status":"completed","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"只根据实际读取的资料回答"},{"role":"system","content":"每个事实必须给出来源"},{"role":"user","content":"批准规则与失败处理如何应对文件基线变化？批准状态和处理动作分别是什么？"},{"role":"assistant","content":""